  "oracle": {
    "kind": "native",
    "name": "Power Pages portal Web API (/_api)",
    "version": "hosted Power Pages trial site, 2026-11-27",
    "scope": "Portal Web API reads on hosted session F1's follow-up trial site (2026-11-27): a Contact-scope root table with a lookup to and a 1:N collection of a custom-provider virtual table, a Global-scope table and a Global-scope child table, each Web API column list naming lookups by their logical name; the provider healthy. Navigation and lambda filters into the virtual table, lookup and collection $expand of it, the virtual table's own reads, member routes, select-less, /$count and $apply refusals on both scopes, and navigation /$count in every shape. Projection as the hosted-f1 odata-shapes suite, without the provider's own echo column pqf1_query. Runs a and b."
  },
